{\up $}{\footnote\pard\plain{\up $} V01.00 Changes}
{\up #}{\footnote\pard\plain{\up #} V01.00_Changes}
\pard \fs36 V01.00 changes since Beta3
\par \fs24 
\par \pard\li355\fi-355\tx355 1.Toolbars are no longer available in \b Full Screen Mode\plain\fs24  (Shift F3).
\par 2.Revised \b Specimen Change\plain\fs24  Macro to handle case where the Gun is Off
\par 3.Macro files generated for \b Save Conditions\plain\fs24  now include statements to initialise the stage on request.
\par 4.The datazone and parameters now freeze if the image is frozen. (This means both halves in split mode must be frozen)
\par 5. On the SEM Control Apertures tab the Gun Align button is disabled in Novice Mode.
\par \page
