\pard\tx355 \fs36 V01.00 User Actions
\par \pard\tx355 \fs24 The Standard Macro Library has changed since Beta3
\par \pard\tx355 
\par \pard\tx355 The \b Specimen Change\plain\fs24  Macro is now version 2
\par \pard\tx355 
\par \pard\tx355 To use this latest version 
\par \pard\li715\fi-355\tx715 Display the Macro Editor (Tools - Macro Editor)
\par Select Library-Merge Standard
\par \pard\tx715 
\par \pard\tx715 This must be done for each User Directory
\par \page
{\up $}{\footnote\pard\plain{\up $} V01.01 Bugs Fixed}
{\up #}{\footnote\pard\plain{\up #} V01.01_Bugs_Fixed}
\pard \fs36 V01.01 Major Bugs Fixed
\par \fs24 
\par 1. Resource problem associated with running macros from User Interface fixed.
\par 2. Fix problem which could sometimes result in burnt spot on sample.
\par \page
{\up $}{\footnote\pard\plain{\up $} V01.01 Changes}
{\up #}{\footnote\pard\plain{\up #} V01.01_Changes}
\pard \fs36 V01.01 Changes
\par \fs24 
\par 1. Annotation merge for TIFF files now adapts colour according to background
\par 2. Annotation text is now created as it is typed in the dialog.
\par 3. Image gallery. Right button click displays pop up menu.
\par 4. Profile line now has cursor indicators
\par 5. Rotate Backlash added to User Preferences
\par 6. Save Conditions now includes Auto Brightness/Contrast  settings and Stage User Limits
\par 7. The automatic selection of mouse adjustment parameters associated with the SEM Control Panel has been discontinued.
\par \pard 8. Macro Buttons display macro progress
\par 9. User Preferences directory selection improved.
\par 10. The key F12 is no longer used for macros. It now aborts stage movement.
\par 11. The \b Vent\plain\fs24  command is now disabled until EHT is off 
\par \page
