{\up $}{\footnote\pard\plain{\up $} V01.01 New}
{\up #}{\footnote\pard\plain{\up #} V01.01_New}
\pard \fs36 V01.01 New
\par \pard\li355\fi-355\tx355 \fs24 1. \uldb \b User Accounting\plain\b\fs24 {\v 2.G16KP@admin32.hlp}\plain\fs24  Introduced
\par 2. Support for Integrated X-Ray Manager introduced.
\par 4. Ctrl C now copies data from the currently selected Measurement Objects to the\uldb \b  clipboard\plain\b\fs24 {\v 1IGA0_U@imgmgr.hlp}.\plain\fs24 
\par 5. Histogram now has bin cursors
\par 6. Supervisor may now define\uldb  \b maximum EHT selectable\plain\b\fs24 {\v 157UFWM@tabmgr.hlp}\plain\fs24  (Right click on SEM Control Gun Tab)
\par 7. \uldb \b Undo Stage Goto\plain\b\fs24 {\v KH.ZCT@tabmgr.hlp}\plain\fs24  added to SEM Control Panel Stage Tab
\par \pard\li355\fi-355\tx355 8. Macro instruction to assign functions to Hard Panel (Mark2)\uldb \b  Knobs\plain\b\fs24 {\v 99ABXK@leom.hlp}\plain\fs24 
\par 9. Macro 'Start' will be executed on User Interface start up if the macro exists.
\par 10. Hold Airlock Vacuum command added to Airlock panel
\par 11. "\uldb \b How To\plain\b\fs24 {\v Contents@how_to.hlp}\plain\fs24 " section added to Help
\par 12. "\uldb \b Getting Started\plain\b\fs24 {\v Contents@getstart.hlp}\plain\fs24 " section added to Help
\par 13. Facility for \uldb \b Common Macros\plain\b\fs24 {\v HBU_9D@leom.hlp}\plain\fs24  added
\par 14. \b Area Parameter\plain\fs24  added for Radial and Linewidth measurement objects.
\par \pard\li355\fi-355\tx355 15  Annotation and Measurement - additional preferences for action on object creation.(\uldb \b Return To Select Mode\plain\b\fs24 {\v 15HWEH_@imgmgr.hlp}\plain\fs24  and \uldb \b Select on create\plain\b\fs24 {\v 689UHW@imgmgr.hlp}\plain\fs24 )
\par 16.\b  \uldb Reduced forma\plain\uldb\fs24 t\plain\fs24 {\v 1.9L0.J@imgmgr.hlp}(no labels, adjacent floating single value) for Angular, Height, Width, adjustable Height, adjustable Width measurement objects
\par 17. \uldb \b Export Image in BMP Format\plain\b\fs24 {\v 9K5T59@imgmgr.hlp}\plain\fs24 
\par 18. \uldb \b Export Image in JPEG Format\plain\b\fs24 {\v 8PJKNY@imgmgr.hlp}\plain\fs24 
\par \pard\li355\fi-355\tx355 19 \uldb \b Joystick disable\plain\b\fs24 {\v 0ILNKA@tabmgr.hlp}\plain\fs24  parameter added to stage Tab
\par 20 \uldb \b Protected Z\plain\b\fs24 {\v K8LPPZ@tabmgr.hlp}\plain\fs24  mode for stage added to stage Tab
\par 21 \uldb \b Compucentric functions\plain\uldb\fs24  \plain\fs24 {\v GP9BLC@stage.hlp} added.( Tilt, Rotate and Sample Horizontal alignment).
\par 22. \uldb \b Image Import\plain\b\fs24 {\v 6LG1R4@imgmgr.hlp}\plain\fs24  now has \b Fit to Image\plain\fs24  option and Change directory Option
\par 23.\uldb \b  Image Export\plain\b\fs24 {\v 8BP7F1@imgmgr.hlp}\plain\fs24  now has \b Change directory\plain\fs24  option
\par 24 New User Attribute \uldb \b Gun Align Privilege\plain\b\fs24 {\v 3T35GP@admin32.hlp}\plain\fs24 
\par \pard\li355\fi-355\tx355 25.Facility for a \uldb \b Common Toolbar\plain\b\fs24 {\v 5XXH_AL@tooledit.hlp}\plain\fs24  added
\par 26.New parameter \b Image Pixel Size \plain\fs24 (store pixel size) added to complement\b  Pixel size \plain\fs24 (display pixel size)
\par 27 Addition of \ul \b\ul Compact User Database\plain\b\fs24 {\v 4FMQ7H@admin32.hlp}\plain\fs24 , \ul \b\ul Repair User Database\plain\b\fs24 {\v 1AZ3ZX.@admin32.hlp}\plain\fs24  functions to Administrator
\par 28.\ul \b\ul EHT Off @ Log Off\plain\b\fs24 {\v ABHFR7@tabmgr.hlp}\plain\fs24  setting added
\par 29 Wide File List option added to \uldb \b Import\plain\b\fs24 {\v 6LG1R4@imgmgr.hlp}\plain\fs24  and \uldb \b Export\plain\b\fs24 {\v 8BP7F1@imgmgr.hlp}\plain\fs24  File Dialogs
\par \pard\li355\fi-355\tx355 30.\b Reset Display LUT\plain\fs24  added to Image Window popup menu
\par \page
