{\up $}{\footnote\pard\plain{\up $} V01.01 Required Actions on upgrade}
{\up #}{\footnote\pard\plain{\up #} V01.01_Required_Actions_on_upgrade}
\pard\keepn \fs36 V01.01 Required Actions on upgrade
\par \pard \fs24 The following actions are required when upgrading from an earlier version.
\par 
\par \b\fs32 Service action
\par \plain\fs24 Recalibration of display \b Mix Delay\plain\fs24  and \b Window Position \plain\fs24 offsets
\par 
\par \b\fs32 User Action
\par \plain\fs24 There are modified macros in the standard macro library which must be merged into all user macro libraries. 
\par Therefore the following must be done for each User Directory (typically this means that each user who logs on after the upgrade should perform these actions)
\par \pard\li355\fi-355\tx355 \f5 \{bmc bm0.bmp\}\f2 \tab Select \b Tools\plain\fs24  - \b Macro Editor\plain\fs24 
\par \f5\b \{bmc bm0.bmp\}\plain\fs24 \tab From the Macro Editor menu select \b Library\plain\fs24  - \b Merge Standard
\par \page
