\pard \fs36 V02.00 Bugs fixed since V01.01
\par \pard\li355\fi-355\tx355 \f5\fs24 \{bmc bm1.bmp\}\f2\fs36 \tab \fs24 Results panel attributes were lost when reloading annotation from file
\par \f5 \{bmc bm1.bmp\}\f2 \tab Switching from Normal mode to emission caused temporary image disturbance (1500 only)
\par \f5 \{bmc bm1.bmp\}\f2 \tab Undefined help context identifier when F1 on User interface window or selecting LEO-32 help from menu
\par \f5 \{bmc bm1.bmp\}\f2 \tab Accuracy of \b centre point\plain\fs24  and \b centre feature\plain\fs24  affected by which output device was selected
\par \f5 \{bmc bm1.bmp\}\f2 \tab loading state which contained disabled instructions caused lock up when loaded for a second time
\par \pard\li355\fi-355\tx355 \f5 \{bmc bm1.bmp\}\f2 \tab Selecting \b snap to grid\plain\fs24  for a \b point to point object\plain\fs24  caused cursor to disappear.
\par \f5 \{bmc bm1.bmp\}\f2 \tab Macro instruction to Run Application failed if command line arguments supplied
\par \f5 \{bmc bm1.bmp\}\f2 \tab Adjusting Gamma parameter was not disabled when not in gamma mode.
\par \page
{\up $}{\footnote\pard\plain{\up $} V02.00 New}
{\up #}{\footnote\pard\plain{\up #} V02.00_New}
\pard\keepn \fs36 V02.00 New functionality
\par \pard \fs24 Note: If running this help from the CD the links below will fail.
\par 
\par 1. Clicking the Pressure readout on the SEM Control Vacuum tab changes units.
\par 2. Macro instructions now have \uldb timeout\plain\fs24 {\v 1280J7M>main@leom.hlp} facility
\par 3. Supervisor function in macro Editor to \uldb save Common macros\plain\fs24 {\v 5H6LYA>main@leom.hlp}.
\par 4. Supervisor function in toolbar editor to save \uldb common toolbar\plain\fs24 {\v 5XXH_AL>main@tooledit.hlp}
\par 5. Ability for User to \uldb define own Icon bitmaps\plain\fs24 {\v 7BKWFD>main@tooledit.hlp}.
\par \pard\li355\fi-355\tx355 6. Alternative parameters for Stigmation correction (\b Stig X only\plain\fs24 , \b Stig Y only\plain\fs24 ) and on 1500 for aperture alignment (\b Aper Align X only\plain\fs24 , \b Aper Align Y only\plain\fs24 ) permitting independant mouse adjustment of X and Y parameters. See \uldb \b Customising default files\plain\b\fs24 {\v N31_RN@leom.hlp}\plain\fs24 .
\par 7.BSD Auto ranging may be switched off in the \uldb \b BSD Control panel\plain\b\fs24 {\v 22PD_35@dlgmgr.hlp}\plain\fs24  to permit more controlled setting of contrast level
\par 8 Access to\uldb \b  Image Capture mode\plain\b\fs24 {\v 28QMYW@sem.hlp}\plain\fs24  is now available.
\par \pard\li355\fi-355\tx355 9.Limited duration keycode protected functions added for Service Use
\par 10. The Administrator may be started from the UIF Menu (Tools - Admin)
\par \page
