{\up $}{\footnote\pard\plain{\up $} V02.01 Bugs fixed}
{\up #}{\footnote\pard\plain{\up #} V02.01_Bugs_fixed}
\pard \fs36 V02.01 Bugs fixed since V02.00
\par \fs24 
\par 1. Loss of Keyboard focus on Log On under Windows98
\par 2  The 400 Administrator prevented DDE Access changes
\par 3. (400 only) Centre point/feature failed if initial beamshift was non zero.
\par 4. Image processing filter corrupted image
\par 5. Printing/saving images with annotation failed to fully release system resources.
\par 6. User accounting crashed if review by owner was selected when no owners are defined.
\par 7. (400 only) Stage rotate failed to take shortest route.
\par \pard 8. Image Gallery failed to display files starting with numeric character
\par 9. F2 now toggles toolbar on/off
\par 10.(1500 only). The Filament age value now includes periods when the Gun is on and the PC is off
\par 11. SEM Control Stage tab: Goto M now functions correctly.
\par \page
