\par \pard \b\fs24 NOTE: If accessed from the installation CD the Links below will fail\plain\fs24 .
\par 1. Cancel added to Log On Dialog
\par 2. Stage user limits saved/restored on Log Off/Log On
\par 3  Stage \uldb \b Survey Mode\plain\b\fs24 {\v 4_DGYJ5@tabmgr.hlp}\plain\fs24  added.
\par 4  User Interface menu '\uldb \b File - Save For Restore\plain\b\fs24 {\v 22SW0AT@sem.hlp}\plain\fs24 ' added.
\par 5. User Interface menu '\uldb \b View - datazone - load User Datazone\plain\b\fs24 {\v 1FH8QBC@sem.hlp}\plain\fs24 '  added.
\par 6. Annotation 'sticky panel' properties now has '\uldb \b Save datazone\plain\b\fs24 {\v GUT3JV@imgmgr.hlp}\plain\fs24 ' function.
\par \pard 7. \uldb \b Second Image Window\plain\b\fs24 {\v 4AHWGBN@leoserv.hlp}\plain\fs24  functions. Load or drop files into it for Pan and Zoom.
\par 8. Can now drop TIF or BMP files onto UIF Image Window to load into store. \uldb \b Drag and Drop\plain\b\fs24 {\v 1NJSYVQ@sem.hlp}
\par \plain\fs24 9. Can drop ANN and DZ files onto UIF Image Window to load annotation and datazones
\par 10. Can now\b  \plain\fs24 Drag files from \uldb \b Image gallery\plain\b\fs24 {\v 1NJSYVQ@gallery.hlp}\plain\fs24  to drop on other Windows
\par 11. Support added for Makro MK2 and Fjeld 5" Stages (1500 only).
\par \pard 12. Optional \uldb \b FTP Remote Archiving Utility\plain\b\fs24 {\v _1ZQP_@imgarc.hlp}\plain\fs24  added
