{\up $}{\footnote\pard\plain{\up $} V02.04 Bugs Fixed}
{\up #}{\footnote\pard\plain{\up #} V02.04_Bugs_Fixed}
\pard \fs36 V02.04 Bugs Fixed since V02.03
\par \pard\li355\fi-355\tx355 \fs24 1.\fs36 \tab \fs24 LEO 1400VP only: Fixes problem where on switching from VP to HV mode.the beam sometimes fails to turn on.
\par 2.\tab Fixes problem with RemCon32 where the STG? command is sometimes not recognised.
\par 3.\tab At very high magnifications the pixel size was reported as 0 nm.
\par 4.\tab Increases accuracy of displayed measurement values when in nm range.
\par 5.\tab Fixes problem when trying to copy string variable annotation parameters (e.g. UserName) to clipboard
\par 6.\tab Fixes problem with Cartesian 95/98 stage causing it to hang on initialisation if rotate limit not fitted.
\par \pard\li355\fi-355\tx355 7.\tab Fixes problem in RemCon32 where 4 character commands are not recognised unless followed by a separator.
\par 8.\tab Fixes problem with Stage Navigation graphical display where Cartesian 95/98 stage has incorrect centre of rotation on 1400/1400VP Series.
\par 9.\tab Fixes problem where XRay linescan scaling was used for Linescan.
\par 10.\tab User Accounting review data presentation corrected and revised.
\par 11.\tab Fjeld Stage (Leo 1560) M axis initialisation speed problem fixed
\par 12.\tab Modifications to LEOAPI Object control for use with SIS Software.
\par \pard\li355\fi-355\tx355 13.\tab Modification for Administrator User Privileges on LEO 1525 systems.
\par 14.\tab Fixes problem where auto file numbering could get out of step when requesting file export from icon then from dialog.
\par 15.\tab Fixes problem where a temporary file sometimes remained undeleted.
\par 16.\tab Fixes problem on LEO 400 Series where EHT Off / Beam On sequence doesn't restore beam
\par 17.\tab Fixes problem of Z step size on LEO 400 Series Eucentric stage.
\par \page
