\fs36 V02.04 Hardware Requirements - LEO 400 Series
\par \pard \fs24 This software will run on any LEO 420, 430, 435VP,  438VP and 440  which has been delivered with Windows95/Windows98, or has been upgraded with the factory supplied Windows95/98 upgrade kit.
\par 
\par Note that unless a Cartesian 95 stage is fitted that a Trackerball option is required for motorised stage control.
