\par \b General\plain\fs24 
\par \pard\li355\fi-355\tx355 \f5 \{bmc bm1.bmp\}\f2 \tab Support for the French and German language is only partially supported.
\par \f5 \{bmc bm1.bmp\}\f2 \tab Stage Control Manager navigation graphical display does not yet support all types of sample holders.
\par \f5 \{bmc bm1.bmp\}\f2 \tab DDE Image Capture does not work in Office 97 when running under Windows 98. Use clipboard copy/paste as an alternative.
\par \f5 \{bmc bm1.bmp\}\f2 \tab In the Administrator on the Configuration Stage Tab there are now check boxes to enable/disable individual stage axes. These will only be effective if this function is supported by the version of stage firmware fitted.
