\fs36 New Tungsten filament types
\par \pard \fs20 Following the introduction of a new filament type in the LEO 1400/1400VP series after serial No. -03-00 two additional filament type parameters have been added.
\par  \fs24 
\par \fs20 If you have a 1400/1400VP series instrument and use filaments with LEO part number 340602-8106.000 then select either Tungsten or W(Zeiss).
\par If you have a 1400/1400VP and use Agar filaments LEO part no 102079 then select W(Agar).\fs24 
\par \page
